      ports_analysis   → ports
      rules            → firewall_rules     (was too generic)
      iptables_nft     → firewall_iptables  (unifies firewall_* namespace)
      firewall_stack   → firewall_drivers   ("drivers" is what the check audits)
    Finding key prefixes, locale namespaces, EXPLAIN_KEYS entries, CIS
    refs, profile overrides, bash completion + tests all migrated. The
    section header titles (locale-rendered) are unchanged; the breaking
    surface is the script-visible token name only.
  * BREAKING — --json-v1 retired (F-3). The v0.6.x legacy JSON schema
    (default before v0.7.0) is removed: --json-v1 raises a CLI error
    pointing at CHANGELOG.md for the field-by-field v1→v2 migration table.
    SCHEMA_V1_REQUIRED_KEYS / SCHEMA_V1_FULL_KEYS constants + _build_v1
    + _populate_v1_full_blocks helpers deleted. v2 has been the default
    since v0.7.0 (4 majeures); v0.6.x was EOL since v0.7.2.
