    profile listed but never existed; workstation is an alias to
    desktop; container is the real third profile), --list-checks /
    --list-profiles / --min-level=info / --format=text doc-only flags
    removed (they don't exist in cli.py), webhook JSON sample
    structure corrected (alerts/warnings are integer counts not
    arrays of objects), webhook timeout 5s -> 10s, max profile
    extends depth 5 -> 8 levels.
